    {
      "id": "r57-gosse-experiments",
      "topic": "Gosse actual versus proposed experiments",
      "requirement": "Separate actual reports from requested experiments. DCP-LETT-1962 thanks Gosse for bald-pate information but says the actual coo is still to be heard; DCP-LETT-2082 reports Darwin’s freshwater hatchling/adhesion observations and asks Gosse to try an analogous sea-mollusc experiment. Do not substitute later memoir or publication material for Gosse’s missing answer, and keep Darwin’s hypothesis explicitly qualified.",
      "source_ids": [
        "DCP-LETT-1962",
        "DCP-LETT-2082"
      ],
      "exact_source_evidence": [
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1962",
          "body_paragraph": 1,
          "quote": "I thank you warmly for your extremely kind letter & for your information about the Bald-Pate, which is quite sufficient. When we meet I shall beg to hear the actual coo!",
          "char_start": 0,
          "char_end": 169,
          "source_sha256": "a96c6c91bcc608c3543f7eebe9057da738d8f9da5f2082ee7643ba27671263a6",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[2]"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-2082",
          "body_paragraph": 1,
          "quote": "Whether this is so I do not know, & indeed do not believe it is so, but I found when there were many very young Molluscs in a small vessel with aquatic plants, amongst which I placed a dried Ducks foot, that the little barely visible shells often crawled over it, & that they adhered so firmly that they cd. not be shaken off,",
          "char_start": 486,
          "char_end": 812,
          "source_sha256": "d386860a9715296e37b0398b14617bbb0b7e2fdc43ed62c30a9a88a31912b24e",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[2]"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-2082",
          "body_paragraph": 2,
          "quote": "try an analogous experiment with some sea-molluscs, especially any strictly littoral species,—hatching them in numbers in a smallish vessel",
          "char_start": 336,
          "char_end": 475,
          "source_sha256": "d386860a9715296e37b0398b14617bbb0b7e2fdc43ed62c30a9a88a31912b24e",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[3]"
        }
      ],
      "source_provenance": [
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1962",
          "source_path": "data/raw/dcp/1856-1857/pages/DCP-LETT-1962.html",
          "source_html_sha256": "a96c6c91bcc608c3543f7eebe9057da738d8f9da5f2082ee7643ba27671263a6",
          "xml_path": "data/raw/epsilon/ab0d973bae05b54d68d82d068211015996cfec06/expansions/1856-1857/letters/DCP-LETT-1962.xml",
          "xml_sha256": "7372e5e19ef0d6f2f3fe1eeda6ae66a782d1b60ffe1836d2d81bdeb4c5dff422",
          "verified_xml_dates": [
            {
