      "requirement": "Keep DCP-LETT-3791 scoped to an oral paragraph Falconer read from his paper, with Darwin’s explicitly hypothetical Owen reply. A later printed page is not the manuscript prompt, and DCP-LETT-3509’s invitation/coach logistics do not establish attendance. Export must preserve uncertainty and omit later editorial dating/publication apparatus.",
